# Host runtime secret only. This file is documentation, not auto-loaded config.
# Supply the real value through your private service environment, never a module.
# Bind it in runtime JSON as:
# backends.discord.secret_sources.bot_token = "env:FLEXMODULE_DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN"
# An empty value is invalid; no token is supplied in this example.
FLEXMODULE_DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN=
#
# Application/guild/channel IDs, immutable image RepoDigests, module identity,
# approvals, resource bounds and supervisor settings belong in operator JSON.
# GUILD_ID, PLUGIN_PATH and implicit DISCORD_TOKEN loading are not v2 contracts.
# See README.md and the chosen module's README before generating an installation.